Freedoom 0.13.0 in WYRMFIRE

WYRMFIRE level data is converted from Freedoom (https://freedoom.github.io),
Copyright (c) 2001-2024 Contributors to the Freedoom project, under the
BSD 3-Clause licence in COPYING.adoc. This directory holds COPYING.adoc,
CREDITS and CREDITS-MUSIC verbatim from the 0.13.0 tag (see VERSION).

Licence notes for the files the converter reads (freedoom1.wad: map
lumps, sprites, sounds, music, PLAYPAL):
  - Everything is under the BSD 3-Clause licence in COPYING.adoc, except
    as listed here.
  - lumps/playpal/ and lumps/colormap/ in the source repository carry a
    GPL-2.0 COPYING file; the PLAYPAL generator script is marked
    GPL-2.0-or-later. The converter reads PLAYPAL only to compute a grey
    level per colour for 1-bit thresholding; no palette bytes are written
    to a level disk. COLORMAP is not read.
  - dist/COPYING.CC0 (CC0) covers the AppStream metainfo files, which
    WYRMFIRE does not use.
